dsh-bg is a local-only derivative of beautiCode's DeepSeek Harness bridge
(package `beauticode-dsh`, https://github.com/starsstreaming/beautiCode),
MIT licensed. The original copyright and LICENSE file are retained.

Changes made in this fork:
  - removed the online skin centre (`gallery.js`, `gallery-host.mjs`,
    `skin-center.json` and the /__beauticode/ui/gallery/* routes), so the
    plugin makes no outbound network requests at all;
  - removed the hard-coded third-party catalogue URL it shipped with;
  - restricted beautiCode's [class*="_fade"]{display:none} rule to empty sidebar
    decoration layers: in this DSH build
    "_fade" marks scroll-edge masks, and ChatGroupSeat carries fadeTop/fadeBottom
    on the same div as its collapsible body, so the rule hid the whole reasoning
    block whenever its scroll edges changed, which is continuously while
    reasoning streams;
  - added `framing.js`, which provides background pan/zoom framing and
    sidebar/interface transparency controls;
  - isolated composer frosting on a decorative material layer, preserving
    fixed overlay coordinates, and selected input surfaces using the Host's
    explicit data-composer-card marker instead of scanning draft geometry;
  - rebranded the package, plugin id and installer from beauticode-* to dsh-bg.

The bundled theme in `themes/internal-beyond` keeps its own NOTICE.md.
